    <item>
      <title>Grey Parrot</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/grey-parrot/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/grey-parrot/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Real-time AI bidirectional speech translation integrated as a Chrome extension sidebar in Amazon Connect&amp;rsquo;s CCP interface. Enables live translated transcripts during calls, supporting 12+ languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built with Deepgram Live API for speech-to-text, Google Translate for translation, a FastAPI backend, and AudioWorklet for real-time PCM audio processing. No hardware splitters required — fully browser-based deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
